<Placemark>
<name>Temple Pavilion entry</name>
<description>The door to the pavilion is locked from the outside, but can be unlocked from inside the Temple Pavilion office after the player reaches it via the underground tunnel entrance. Attached reference images show 3 exterior views and 2 interior views from different distances and angles. The windows on the east and west side of the pavilion are shuttered from the outside. The south side door is also shuttered, but the shutters can be opened when the door is unlocked from inside the office.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.82817940490548,18.29811982654249,39.9429523639537</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>CheyTac M200 location</name>
<Point><coordinates>-64.82820445735522,18.29812880782307,39.56067732143641</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>vantage point</name>
<description>The player can take up positions behind the low wall and use the CheyTac M200 to defeat Crimson Two. The player can also use a number of other viable approaches, and different positions and distances, this is just one of the alternative ways of dealing with Crimson Two.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.82810728501891,18.2982883573747,40.10240138575488</coordinates></Point>
