<Placemark>
<name>northwestern beach bungalow</name>
<description>Contains collectible Intel in the form of a flash drive and a file containing several printouts of highly compromising and incriminating photos showing then president-elect Barry James Crodyn and SCOTUS justices Walter Pedilla and Creighton Howard engaging in multiple acts of immoral and illicit conduct.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.82474162090152,18.30253540923626,11.88302522093215</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>boat</name>
<description>Not interactable by the player, just visual detail to communicate environmental storytelling. Implies an off-screen attempt to flee / evacuate by water that failed or was interrupted. Contains discarded ligatures, a half empty backpack, and smears of blood, but no body. The port area is deserted when the player arrives.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.82534768068139,18.30225062725353,0.4526214154048134</coordinates></Point>
